Significant modifications by Mino:
- Reduced the multi-provider channel system to the single Mino account
  channel (api.mino.baby), billed through the Mino account balance.
- Replaced BYOK credential resolution with the signed-in account token
  resolved through the host's deepseekAccount service.
- Removed subscription OAuth channels, ComfyUI, Studio/workbench,
  gallery, inspiration library, and the tldraw canvas.
- Rebranded plugin identity, routes, presentation metadata kinds, and
  user-facing copy from dsh-image-gen to mino-image.
